  "description": "An easy and reliable way to perform fire-and-forget, delayed and recurring, long-running, short-running, CPU or I/O intensive tasks in .NET applications. No Windows Service / Task Scheduler required.\nBacked by Redis, SQL Server, SQL Azure or MSMQ. This is a .NET alternative to Sidekiq, Resque and Celery.\nhttps://www.hangfire.io/",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
